  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_ccd65e4849284f7caff12c83207eeac3",
      "statement": "deploy.sh requires MYFEEDER_PG_PASSWORD and MYFEEDER_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (the script has no default for them and runs under set -euo pipefail), while MYFEEDER_RAINDROP_API_TOKEN and MYFEEDER_TYPESAFE_API_KEY default to empty with a printed warning, leaving Raindrop or interest scoring disabled in that deployment but the app still starting.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy.sh",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:9bbe60767396efc241f35198f9d57261d2bb5e0ec513ea8f8aa13e3f21bc148e"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f0317bc7cdd740df9e75fa48daa17ac0",
      "statement": "Every secret value deploy.sh passes to helm upgrade goes through --set, so none of MYFEEDER_PG_PASSWORD, MYFEEDER_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, MYFEEDER_RAINDROP_API_TOKEN, or MYFEEDER_TYPESAFE_API_KEY may contain a ',' or '\\\\', since either character breaks Helm's --set value parsing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy.sh#L24-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:58900652d0fc7f0b312fe6dd574f20ca3cf66e97fb6ad629e0cb97886a8b1042:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5e1eb8b0999a4219a54b4e167b8cafb7",
      "statement": "deploy.sh's VERSION defaults to the output of `./gradlew currentVersion -q`, so a chart-only redeploy against an already-released tag (no new image build) must pass the version explicitly as the first argument, since axion-release's no-arg default resolves to the next snapshot version which matches no pushed image.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy.sh#L4-L4",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3cae3cb7c19f24881edb3610699bf9518a0e8d8141ca6eb343576d9fb8c10b2a:"
        }
