    {
      "id": "claim_60c18071c2fd41a3ae63f668e58fc704",
      "statement": "After committing a throttled sweep-batch-size to application.yaml, the out-of-band MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE env var must be explicitly removed with `kubectl -n myfeeder set env deploy/myfeeder MYFEEDER_INTEREST_SWEEPBATCHSIZE-`, because Helm upgrade's three-way merge does not remove an env var that was never declared in the chart's own manifests, so it would otherwise keep silently overriding the committed value.",
